cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use fungioutline, please cite it using this metadata."
type: software
title: "fungioutline: Tools for Fungal Taxonomic Outlines and Genome Sampling"
version: 0.0.0.9000
date-released: "2026-05-08"
abstract: >
  fungioutline provides tidy R tools for importing, validating, updating, and
  analyzing expert-curated fungal taxonomic outlines together with public genome
  metadata, BUSCO quality summaries, optional NCBI sequence availability checks,
  and phylogenomic sampling workflows.
authors:
  - name: "FungiOutline contributors"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - fungal taxonomy
  - systematics
  - phylogenomics
  - genome metadata
  - BUSCO
  - R package
